r8101: select the complete EEE bitmap API implementation for this 6.6 backport.

Pinned Padavan source ec9ef10 applies MediaTek 999-1703 EEE backports to Linux
6.6.133, so ethtool_ops uses ethtool_keee and linkmode bitmaps. The downloaded
r8101 driver already implements that API behind a 6.9 guard. Select its whole
implementation on this frozen kernel, preserving the legacy branch and all
existing package patch bytes. This is not a claim about stock Linux 6.6.

